{"id":"ncrp-7-2-3","ref":"Mil 4.1.6","title":"Milindapañha","titleEn":"Nine Who Cannot Keep a Secret","source":"NCRP Lesson 7 · Further reading 3","credit":"English: course exercise book, after T. W. Rhys Davids, The Questions of King Milinda (1890–1894).","bookLesson":7,"section":"further","paras":[{"t":[["“"],["bhante","bhante"],[" "],["Nāgasena","nāgasena"],[", "],["nav’ime","nav’ime"],[" "],["puggalā","puggalā"],[" "],["mantitaṃ","mantitaṃ"],[" "],["guyhaṃ","guyhaṃ"],[" "],["vivaranti","vivaranti"],[", "],["na","na"],[" "],["dhārenti","dhārenti"],[". "],["katame","katame"],[" "],["nava","nava"],["? "],["rāga-carito","rāga-carito"],[", "],["dosa-carito","dosa-carito"],[", "],["moha-carito","moha-carito"],[", "],["bhīruko","bhīruko"],[", "],["āmisa-garuko","āmisa-garuko"],[", "],["itthī","itthī"],[", "],["soṇḍo","soṇḍo"],[", "],["paṇḍako","paṇḍako"],[", "],["dārako’","dārako’"],["”"],["ti","ti"],[".\n"],["thero","thero"],[" "],["āha","āha"],[": “"],["tesaṃ","tesaṃ"],[" "],["ko","ko"],[" "],["doso’","doso’"],["”"],["ti","ti"],["?"]],"en":"“Bhante Nāgasena, these nine kinds of people reveal a secret that has been discussed with them, and do not preserve it. What nine? The one of lustful character, the one of hating character, the one of deluded character, the coward, one greedy for gain, a woman, a drunkard, a eunuch, a child.”\nThe Elder said: “Of these, what is the fault?”"},{"t":[["“"],["rāga-carito","rāga-carito"],[", "],["bhante","bhante"],[" "],["Nāgasena","nāgasena"],[", "],["rāga-vasena","rāga-vasena"],[" "],["mantitaṃ","mantitaṃ"],[" "],["guyhaṃ","guyhaṃ"],[" "],["vivarati","vivarati"],[", "],["na","na"],[" "],["dhāreti","dhāreti"],["; "],["duṭṭho","duṭṭho"],[" "],["dosa-vasena","dosa-vasena"],[" "],["mantitaṃ","mantitaṃ"],[" "],["guyhaṃ","guyhaṃ"],[" "],["vivarati","vivarati"],[", "],["na","na"],[" "],["dhāreti","dhāreti"],["; "],["mūḷho","mūḷho"],[" "],["moha-vasena","moha-vasena"],[" "],["mantitaṃ","mantitaṃ"],[" "],["guyhaṃ","guyhaṃ"],[" "],["vivarati",